   "block": {
    "type": "text",
    "label": "READING · A DIFFERENT SATURDAY",
    "html": "Emily is from Canada. She lives in Toronto with her parents and her brother, Daniel. On Saturdays, Emily usually wakes up at nine. She has breakfast with her family, and then she goes to the gym. In the afternoon, she usually meets her friends at a café. She always wears jeans and sneakers on the weekend.<br><br>But today is a different Saturday. It's 10 a.m., and Emily isn't at the gym. She is at the airport! She is wearing a black dress and a long coat, and she is waiting for her flight to Brazil. Her brother is sitting next to her. He is playing games on his phone. Emily is very happy because she is visiting her best friend in Florianópolis."
   }
